WEBVTT

01:36.330 --> 01:40.000
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.100 --> 01:41.950
[Episode 36]

02:02.640 --> 02:03.310
How did it go?

02:04.480 --> 02:05.680
I was right, wasn't I?

02:10.190 --> 02:11.360
It's too sudden.

02:12.710 --> 02:13.870
They're just shocked.

02:14.410 --> 02:15.430
Once they adjust

02:15.840 --> 02:17.079
and accept the reality,

02:18.310 --> 02:19.190
they won't object.

02:20.120 --> 02:21.520
Guess what my mom said?

02:22.910 --> 02:24.520
She said if I got cancer,

02:24.960 --> 02:26.030
I should pack my things

02:26.030 --> 02:26.840
and find a place

02:27.120 --> 02:27.840
to wait for my death.

02:29.780 --> 02:31.000
That I shouldn't be a burden,

02:31.680 --> 02:33.360
which will make people miss me more after I die.

02:40.520 --> 02:41.430
It's okay.

02:42.910 --> 02:44.910
Anyway, I know you love me too.

02:45.300 --> 02:46.620
I'm very happy.

02:47.300 --> 02:48.460
All these years of waiting

02:48.740 --> 02:49.950
are worth it.

02:50.390 --> 02:51.670
It doesn't really matter if we get married or not.

02:53.280 --> 02:53.840
Fenghua,

02:54.820 --> 02:56.100
you love me

02:56.810 --> 02:58.300
because

02:58.770 --> 02:59.520
I'm stubborn, don't you?

03:00.980 --> 03:02.340
It's the same with this matter.

03:02.750 --> 03:04.000
I've made up my mind.

03:04.970 --> 03:06.430
What others say can't change it.

03:07.000 --> 03:08.110
Don't be silly.

03:08.110 --> 03:09.560
We're both adults.

03:09.560 --> 03:10.400
Don't be childish.

03:10.470 --> 03:11.680
So you know

03:11.680 --> 03:12.470
we're adults.

03:13.280 --> 03:14.880
We're of legal age for marriage.

03:15.000 --> 03:16.190
We have the right to get married.

03:16.210 --> 03:17.680
No one can stop us.

03:20.190 --> 03:20.960
Yesterday…

03:22.750 --> 03:24.560
I told Xingchi about our situation.

03:25.470 --> 03:26.520
Guess what he said?

03:28.840 --> 03:29.710
If you can't make the decision,

03:29.750 --> 03:30.680
don't push yourself too hard.

03:33.310 --> 03:34.079
Leave it to me.

03:36.840 --> 03:38.400
Although I'm not as rich as you,

03:39.910 --> 03:41.150
I can still afford

03:41.310 --> 03:42.430
the betrothal gifts.

03:46.030 --> 03:47.120
You want to marry her,

03:49.280 --> 03:50.630
but she won't agree.

03:51.840 --> 03:52.430
If you

03:52.790 --> 03:54.400
truly want to marry her,

03:55.630 --> 03:56.800
I'll support you

03:58.120 --> 03:59.400
and wish you a happy marriage.

04:04.720 --> 04:05.590
But I beg you

04:05.590 --> 04:07.360
to treat her well.

04:08.870 --> 04:10.940
If you treat her badly, I…

04:11.120 --> 04:12.750
I'll just take her away.

04:13.120 --> 04:15.080
I won't care about brotherhood or anything.

04:23.400 --> 04:24.860
He's put it like that.

04:24.990 --> 04:26.370
What am I supposed to do?

04:27.240 --> 04:28.800
If I'm careless,

04:28.800 --> 04:30.200
my wife might be stolen.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.720
Who could I turn to for help?

04:37.159 --> 04:38.070
In the past,

04:38.700 --> 04:40.110
when I encountered problems,

04:41.090 --> 04:42.270
you always told me

04:42.430 --> 04:43.600
that time smooths things out.

04:45.640 --> 04:47.560
Today, I'm saying those words to you.

04:48.880 --> 04:50.310
As long as we truly love each other

04:50.950 --> 04:52.240
and wish to be together,

04:52.430 --> 04:54.270
any problem can be solved.

04:55.520 --> 04:57.220
It's just a matter of time.

05:05.540 --> 05:06.810
I never expected

05:07.030 --> 05:08.270
that getting sick

05:08.430 --> 05:09.870
would make me so popular.

05:30.350 --> 05:31.260
Don't be afraid.

05:33.090 --> 05:34.230
I'll always be by your side.

05:40.730 --> 05:44.380
[Examination method: cranial CT scan]

05:44.409 --> 05:48.370
[Consider: possible tumor or meningioma tumor]

05:50.500 --> 05:51.400
Is this disease

05:51.720 --> 05:52.870
treatable?

05:53.830 --> 05:54.480
I asked.

05:56.830 --> 05:58.720
They said she needs brain surgery.

06:00.280 --> 06:02.150
The success rate

06:02.310 --> 06:03.750
is very low.

06:10.590 --> 06:11.380
How low?

06:15.010 --> 06:17.350
It's one in ten.

06:22.160 --> 06:23.990
How can it be?

06:25.390 --> 06:26.650
How can it be?

06:27.420 --> 06:28.450
It can't be.

06:29.580 --> 06:30.470
It can't be.

06:34.200 --> 06:35.380
I…

06:36.060 --> 06:39.450
I want to trade my life for our daughter's.

06:39.510 --> 06:40.800
I want to switch places with her.

06:40.820 --> 06:42.670
I want to trade my life for hers.

06:42.700 --> 06:46.820
Why is God so cruel?

06:50.300 --> 06:53.100
Please take my life instead.

07:02.870 --> 07:04.190
It really hasn't changed much, has it?

07:07.750 --> 07:09.720
Are you sure you can find it?

07:10.740 --> 07:11.770
Let's just look.

07:19.060 --> 07:19.900
Here it is.

07:20.470 --> 07:21.030
Come here.

07:23.190 --> 07:26.780
[Wanghe, have you succeeded?]

07:24.550 --> 07:25.070
You wrote it?

07:25.260 --> 07:26.850
The day before we left school,

07:26.880 --> 07:28.090
the three of us all wrote something.

07:30.920 --> 07:31.720
So,

07:32.270 --> 07:33.360
have you succeeded?

07:35.120 --> 07:37.350
By the standards back then,

07:38.090 --> 07:39.050
I guess I could be considered successful.

07:40.110 --> 07:41.950
What about by today's standards?

07:45.159 --> 07:46.710
I'm in my thirties

07:47.040 --> 07:48.240
but still haven't gotten married.

07:48.600 --> 07:49.870
How can I be considered successful?

07:54.920 --> 07:55.720
Where is your desk?

07:55.920 --> 07:56.800
Have you found it?

07:58.580 --> 07:59.670
I didn't write anything.

08:01.270 --> 08:02.290
Impossible.

08:02.950 --> 08:03.950
I really didn't.

08:03.950 --> 08:04.930
Why would I lie to you?

08:05.230 --> 08:06.050
Look for it.

08:08.680 --> 08:10.880
Stop looking. I didn't write anything.

08:11.490 --> 08:12.990
Why don't you believe me?

08:13.370 --> 08:14.800
I must find it.

08:14.950 --> 08:16.510
I want to see what you wrote.

08:17.760 --> 08:18.350
Here it is.

08:20.690 --> 08:21.970
This was your desk, right?

08:22.800 --> 08:23.800
No.

08:23.950 --> 08:24.720
It was!

08:24.800 --> 08:25.480
Come here.

08:26.160 --> 08:26.870
Take a look.

08:27.210 --> 08:28.500
It was not my desk.

08:28.530 --> 08:30.730
Take a look first.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.240
It was not mine.

08:32.270 --> 08:32.909
Look at this.

08:32.909 --> 08:33.600
Look.

08:33.909 --> 08:35.840
It's missing a piece. It was your desk.

08:37.400 --> 08:39.020
Let me see what you wrote.

08:42.789 --> 08:44.120
You really didn't write anything?

08:44.790 --> 08:46.480
I told you I didn't.

08:46.480 --> 08:47.630
Stop looking.

08:47.720 --> 08:48.600
Here it is!

08:54.360 --> 08:56.490
I wish the boy I love

08:56.790 --> 08:57.840
could love me too.

09:00.470 --> 09:01.500
Who's that boy?

09:03.800 --> 09:05.110
I didn't write that.

09:05.720 --> 09:06.960
This is your handwriting.

09:07.230 --> 09:08.170
I can recognize it.

09:13.680 --> 09:15.440
I'm officially informing you now:

09:17.250 --> 09:18.500
the boy you love...

09:19.460 --> 09:20.240
loves you too.

09:25.550 --> 09:26.120
Miss!

09:26.120 --> 09:28.030
He's harassing me!

09:30.270 --> 09:31.910
I'll get beaten up when I get home anyway.

09:33.150 --> 09:34.000
So I might as well

09:34.320 --> 09:35.310
just do whatever I want now.

09:38.150 --> 09:39.960
How dare you mess with me?

09:39.960 --> 09:42.080
So… so audacious!

09:42.150 --> 09:42.960
Miss!

09:43.270 --> 09:45.820
Tell… Tell this boy to stop!

10:25.700 --> 10:26.270
Dad.

10:27.150 --> 10:28.220
You're back.

10:28.640 --> 10:29.890
I just arrived.

10:32.670 --> 10:33.270
Where's Mom?

10:33.650 --> 10:34.370
Asleep.

10:36.510 --> 10:37.910
You should go to sleep too.

10:42.840 --> 10:43.510
Come here.

10:59.600 --> 11:00.960
You and Fenghua...

11:01.080 --> 11:01.960
We're together.

11:08.240 --> 11:09.480
Your mom told me

11:10.080 --> 11:10.720
that

11:10.960 --> 11:12.120
there's a tumor

11:12.120 --> 11:13.030
in Fenghua's brain.

11:13.080 --> 11:13.720
Right?

11:18.960 --> 11:20.000
I've asked the doctor.

11:20.480 --> 11:21.150
It can be treated,

11:21.870 --> 11:22.870
but there are risks.

11:27.870 --> 11:29.030
Are you

11:29.320 --> 11:31.080
truly in love with her?

11:31.240 --> 11:31.840
Or is it because of…

11:31.840 --> 11:32.720
I just love her.

11:34.720 --> 11:35.510
I'm serious.

11:38.880 --> 11:39.780
I know

11:40.450 --> 11:41.510
you and Mom don't approve.

11:41.530 --> 11:42.560
Did I say that?

11:43.330 --> 11:44.510
I don't disagree.

11:48.840 --> 11:49.960
Back then,

11:49.960 --> 11:51.550
when I married your mother,

11:53.140 --> 11:54.180
my parents

11:54.250 --> 11:55.120
didn't agree.

11:55.670 --> 11:58.360
They said your mom was from a poor family

11:58.360 --> 12:00.380
and of humble origins.

12:01.480 --> 12:02.960
I chose my wife myself,

12:03.120 --> 12:03.670
right?

12:03.960 --> 12:05.080
I flipped out at the time.

12:05.080 --> 12:05.870
I-If they wouldn't accept her,

12:05.870 --> 12:08.000
I'd just get your mom on a ship

12:08.000 --> 12:09.150
and live our own life.

12:09.200 --> 12:11.000
At worst, we just wouldn't come back again.

12:13.480 --> 12:14.960
I don't have your courage.

12:18.090 --> 12:18.970
It's alright.

12:19.080 --> 12:19.870
You have me.

12:21.360 --> 12:22.750
You know your mom.

12:22.750 --> 12:25.420
She has a bad temper sometimes,

12:25.720 --> 12:27.080
but she has a kind heart.

12:29.520 --> 12:30.330
I'll handle her.

12:32.780 --> 12:33.550
Really?

13:06.240 --> 13:06.870
Miss,

13:07.310 --> 13:08.400
can I have your number?

13:09.540 --> 13:10.960
I already have a boyfriend.

13:10.980 --> 13:12.090
Who's your boyfriend?

13:12.120 --> 13:13.110
Is he as handsome as me?

13:13.740 --> 13:14.640
Not really.

13:15.370 --> 13:17.440
My boyfriend is a little strange.

13:17.900 --> 13:19.010
He staggers when he walks.

13:19.150 --> 13:20.510
His face twitches,

13:20.730 --> 13:22.230
and he drools when he talks.

13:22.390 --> 13:23.240
Like this?

13:26.550 --> 13:27.480
Go on.

13:28.110 --> 13:29.420
I'm recording it.

13:29.870 --> 13:30.510
Stop.

13:30.630 --> 13:31.970
It's so embarrassing.

13:54.310 --> 13:55.250
Why didn't you open the beers?

14:02.670 --> 14:04.120
Our wives are not home.

14:04.320 --> 14:05.060
Let us

14:06.440 --> 14:07.120
have a drink,

14:08.790 --> 14:09.510
just the two of us.

14:12.150 --> 14:12.870
In-law,

14:14.630 --> 14:15.200
cheers.

14:29.510 --> 14:30.240
Well,

14:31.630 --> 14:32.320
how long

14:32.790 --> 14:33.440
have we

14:34.410 --> 14:35.380
known each other?

14:37.550 --> 14:38.910
36 years.

14:42.550 --> 14:43.550
That's a long time.

14:45.750 --> 14:47.830
We're still good buddies now.

14:48.070 --> 14:49.800
It gotta be fate, right?

14:51.270 --> 14:52.320
This is what they call destiny.

14:52.510 --> 14:52.910
Let's drink.

14:55.140 --> 14:55.910
Boss Xie.

14:58.170 --> 15:01.040
I won't let Fenghua marry Wanghe.

15:05.000 --> 15:06.710
Don't listen to Yan on this matter.

15:07.600 --> 15:09.120
I made this decision myself.

15:10.160 --> 15:10.870
Really?

15:11.150 --> 15:12.270
You don't know.

15:12.670 --> 15:13.670
Fenghua...

15:13.670 --> 15:14.910
If she's sick, get her treated.

15:15.570 --> 15:16.550
It's not a big deal.

15:17.510 --> 15:19.320
Fenghua's condition is not a minor ailment.

15:20.250 --> 15:22.660
We don't even know how long she can live.

15:24.030 --> 15:25.030
You're her father.

15:26.840 --> 15:28.380
You can't jinx it like that.

15:35.270 --> 15:36.240
Let me tell you.

15:37.550 --> 15:39.270
I've talked to Wanghe.

15:40.790 --> 15:43.270
He's head over heels

15:43.270 --> 15:45.030
in love with your daughter.

15:45.150 --> 15:47.780
H-He won't marry anyone but her.

15:50.030 --> 15:50.810
Besides,

15:51.310 --> 15:53.340
when we married our wives back then,

15:53.440 --> 15:55.270
didn't our parents disapprove too?

15:55.910 --> 15:57.960
What did we do?

15:59.230 --> 16:01.120
We were rebellious,

16:01.120 --> 16:03.630
but our children can't be?

16:05.320 --> 16:06.630
Who do you think you are?

16:10.680 --> 16:11.440
Let's drink.

16:12.050 --> 16:12.860
Boss Xie.

16:13.810 --> 16:15.580
I've followed you since I was young.

16:16.940 --> 16:18.990
I listen to you on everything,

16:19.570 --> 16:20.930
big or small.

16:23.290 --> 16:24.900
But this time...

16:28.490 --> 16:29.550
You'll listen to me too,

16:30.240 --> 16:30.790
okay?

16:37.690 --> 16:38.520
Okay?

16:47.190 --> 16:47.940
Okay.

16:52.740 --> 16:53.930
I'll listen to you.

17:41.090 --> 17:42.230
I'll listen to you.

17:45.200 --> 17:47.650
I feel so sorry for Wanghe.

17:49.790 --> 17:50.950
Nonsense.

17:51.520 --> 17:52.640
Don't say that.

17:53.540 --> 17:54.860
It's our children's marriage.

17:56.430 --> 17:57.710
Let them decide for themselves.

17:59.810 --> 18:01.230
It's their fate.

18:03.000 --> 18:04.110
Whether it'll end well or badly…

18:07.430 --> 18:08.930
none of us can decide.

18:15.920 --> 18:16.980
They've spent so much time together

18:18.800 --> 18:20.150
since they were little.

18:21.830 --> 18:23.270
How come I never noticed

18:23.270 --> 18:24.510
any signs between them?

18:31.670 --> 18:32.950
Then,

18:33.780 --> 18:35.000
it's settled.

18:35.290 --> 18:36.290
In-law.

18:38.770 --> 18:39.480
In-law.

18:40.850 --> 18:41.410
Good.

19:04.350 --> 19:05.400
Yan.

19:07.770 --> 19:08.760
Yan.

19:24.810 --> 19:26.710
Yan, do you have a moment?

19:32.350 --> 19:33.230
Yeah.

19:38.460 --> 19:39.320
Let's

19:41.070 --> 19:41.880
have a chat.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.110
Okay.

20:14.510 --> 20:15.510
Our children…

20:15.510 --> 20:16.310
Don't say it.

20:17.590 --> 20:18.400
No need to say it.

20:19.310 --> 20:20.350
I don't agree

20:21.550 --> 20:22.750
with them getting married either.

20:24.750 --> 20:25.590
Don't worry.

20:27.750 --> 20:29.030
I'm well aware of

20:30.270 --> 20:31.350
Fenghua's illness.

20:32.800 --> 20:34.120
I won't let her

20:34.310 --> 20:35.270
become a burden to Wanghe.

20:38.070 --> 20:38.790
Haihong.

20:40.130 --> 20:42.170
We've been friends for so many years.

20:43.030 --> 20:43.830
I understand.

20:44.640 --> 20:45.640
I know.

20:47.040 --> 20:48.710
If I were you…

20:50.680 --> 20:51.790
I wouldn't agree either.

20:52.440 --> 20:53.030
We're the same.

21:04.590 --> 21:05.500
Haihong.

21:08.690 --> 21:09.930
When you have time,

21:11.360 --> 21:12.900
accompany me to the temple.

21:13.610 --> 21:14.170
Okay.

21:15.570 --> 21:16.800
Let's go early

21:17.030 --> 21:17.920
to burn the first incense.

21:18.800 --> 21:19.870
I'm going there

21:20.930 --> 21:22.970
to smash the temple.

21:27.110 --> 21:29.680
That old monk in the temple

21:29.720 --> 21:31.540
once read fortunes for Fenghua.

21:31.880 --> 21:33.350
He said she'd live a great

21:33.350 --> 21:34.400
and happy life.

21:35.530 --> 21:38.050
He said she'd have many children and grandchildren.

21:38.800 --> 21:40.900
It all seems impossible now.

21:42.570 --> 21:44.410
Where is…

21:46.270 --> 21:48.680
Fenghua's happy life?

21:54.470 --> 21:56.200
You know Fenghua

21:56.240 --> 21:58.440
has been a good girl since she was little.

21:58.440 --> 21:59.920
You know that.

22:04.740 --> 22:05.620
Fenghua

22:06.650 --> 22:08.290
has been hesitant to have the surgery

22:08.950 --> 22:11.580
because of her parents.

22:11.600 --> 22:13.610
Now she's finally agreed.

22:13.660 --> 22:15.440
Before she goes into surgery,

22:15.480 --> 22:16.590
can't we give her something

22:16.590 --> 22:19.010
to look forward to, some hope?

22:21.030 --> 22:21.560
You…

22:21.880 --> 22:23.400
You think I want this?

22:25.260 --> 22:26.200
What I'm doing

22:26.200 --> 22:26.790
will make everyone hate me.

22:26.790 --> 22:28.880
You think I want to be the bad guy?

22:30.810 --> 22:31.870
That's Fenghua.

22:32.470 --> 22:34.270
We watched her grow up.

22:34.880 --> 22:37.200
Of course I know she's a good girl!

22:39.510 --> 22:39.960
Mom,

22:41.750 --> 22:42.440
I know

22:43.750 --> 22:44.830
you want what's best for me.

22:46.630 --> 22:48.510
I'm sure you hope

22:48.550 --> 22:49.270
I can be happy

22:49.550 --> 22:50.310
and content.

22:51.090 --> 22:52.360
You don't want me to suffer.

22:53.790 --> 22:54.960
I won't.

22:59.510 --> 23:01.830
Put yourself in my shoes.

23:01.960 --> 23:03.680
If this happened to you,

23:04.070 --> 23:05.550
would you give up on Dad?

23:15.510 --> 23:16.000
I would.

23:21.480 --> 23:22.680
When you're young,

23:23.590 --> 23:25.070
you think love is everything.

23:27.550 --> 23:29.000
But marriage

23:29.880 --> 23:30.960
is like sailing a ship.

23:32.070 --> 23:33.660
The ship has just left the harbor,

23:33.750 --> 23:34.790
but it's already leaking.

23:35.270 --> 23:36.310
So tell me,

23:36.790 --> 23:39.720
how long can you keep sailing?

23:40.440 --> 23:41.960
You'll just watch it sink?

23:43.270 --> 23:44.240
At this moment,

23:44.590 --> 23:45.680
will you abandon the ship

23:46.880 --> 23:48.200
or keep struggling

23:48.270 --> 23:50.750
and then sink with the ship?

23:54.480 --> 23:56.030
You can't understand now

23:57.350 --> 23:58.830
because you haven't realized

23:59.830 --> 24:02.110
how messy life can get.

24:07.470 --> 24:09.240
You guys want to help her,

24:10.310 --> 24:12.160
but it's too big of a favor for anyone to accept.

24:13.600 --> 24:14.960
After all the struggle,

24:17.310 --> 24:18.790
we might not even be able…

24:22.520 --> 24:24.270
to maintain our long friendship

24:24.270 --> 24:25.480
with the Xia family.

24:26.610 --> 24:28.780
Have you thought about that?

24:29.790 --> 24:31.270
You're overthinking it.

24:31.270 --> 24:33.480
-Xia Lao'er and I…
-Shut up!

24:40.960 --> 24:41.920
I've already

24:42.340 --> 24:43.820
made my point clear.

24:44.530 --> 24:46.510
Whether you listen or not,

24:46.720 --> 24:48.400
as long as I'm in this house,

24:49.590 --> 24:51.340
Fenghua can't be part of this family.

25:17.040 --> 25:19.080
♫Who will be there to gently♫

25:19.370 --> 25:21.930
♫Pat me on my shoulder when I need it the most?♫

25:22.540 --> 25:24.950
♫Who is willing to share with me♫

25:25.640 --> 25:27.710
♫Our happiest moments?♫

25:28.360 --> 25:30.490
♫Life is long♫

25:29.090 --> 25:30.050
Mom.

25:30.760 --> 25:31.470
Here.

25:31.290 --> 25:33.760
♫I'm by your side♫

25:31.720 --> 25:33.240
I made you some soup.

25:33.310 --> 25:34.350
If you don't want to eat,

25:34.370 --> 25:35.660
at least have some soup.

25:34.500 --> 25:35.570
♫Witnessing your growth♫

25:35.960 --> 25:36.960
This soup is very nutritious.

25:36.170 --> 25:39.210
♫Gives me strength♫

25:37.270 --> 25:38.550
It took me hours to make it.

25:38.680 --> 25:40.310
I don't have an appetite, Mom.

25:39.910 --> 25:41.120
♫Who can forget the past?♫

25:40.310 --> 25:41.350
Just one sip.

25:41.440 --> 25:42.720
I can't.

25:41.730 --> 25:44.850
♫I've been with you all the way♫

25:43.610 --> 25:46.100
I've also made you some lotus seed soup.

25:45.470 --> 25:47.120
♫Who can predict the future?♫

25:46.270 --> 25:47.770
I'll go get it for you.

25:47.680 --> 25:50.510
♫Long and far, where are you?♫

25:48.030 --> 25:50.220
Mom, stop fussing.

25:50.550 --> 25:51.920
I'll tell you when I'm hungry.

25:51.610 --> 25:53.750
♫With a smile on your face♫

25:52.040 --> 25:52.820
Don't worry.

25:54.650 --> 25:56.570
♫Just like you♫

25:57.440 --> 25:58.670
♫Singing loudly♫

25:59.150 --> 26:01.570
♫Applauding for yourself♫

26:02.360 --> 26:04.370
♫I'm just like you♫

26:05.000 --> 26:06.950
♫I'm strong like you♫

26:07.480 --> 26:09.460
Please, Mom.

26:07.740 --> 26:09.830
♫I'll give my all♫

26:10.000 --> 26:11.920
Can you stop looking so sad all the time?

26:10.270 --> 26:13.000
♫In pursuing my dreams♫

26:11.960 --> 26:13.700
I'm not dead yet.

26:13.700 --> 26:15.850
♫Even if I get hurt♫

26:14.920 --> 26:16.480
Don't say that.

26:16.430 --> 26:18.620
♫Even if there's a storm♫

26:18.480 --> 26:20.030
That's nonsense.

26:19.300 --> 26:21.370
♫Only after the storm♫

26:21.850 --> 26:24.150
♫Will flowers bloom with charming fragrance♫

26:22.720 --> 26:24.110
Don't worry.

26:25.330 --> 26:27.130
♫I'm just like you♫

26:25.480 --> 26:26.830
You'll definitely get better.

26:28.150 --> 26:29.720
♫I'm kind like you♫

26:29.530 --> 26:30.350
Look at you.

26:30.950 --> 26:32.670
♫I need someone just like you♫

26:31.090 --> 26:32.010
You've lost weight.

26:33.010 --> 26:35.900
♫To create a paradise♫

26:33.920 --> 26:36.000
Is it because my cooking is bad?

26:36.970 --> 26:38.960
When I was little, you complained about my baby fat.

26:37.020 --> 26:38.970
♫Our voices are wings♫

26:39.000 --> 26:40.200
Do you remember?

26:39.640 --> 26:41.690
♫That will convey hope♫

26:41.000 --> 26:42.270
Now you're complaining that I'm too thin.

26:42.170 --> 26:43.510
♫All of our efforts♫

26:43.310 --> 26:44.450
Just tell me,

26:43.970 --> 26:46.060
♫Becomes powerful with love♫

26:44.790 --> 26:45.510
am I beautiful?

26:46.100 --> 26:47.100
Yes.

26:47.670 --> 26:51.000
♫Just like you♫

26:47.750 --> 26:48.550
My daughter

26:48.780 --> 26:49.960
is the most beautiful.

26:50.640 --> 26:52.010
That's enough.

26:52.240 --> 26:55.130
When I go out now, I turn heads everywhere.

26:56.070 --> 26:56.880
Just today,

26:57.030 --> 26:58.200
a punk

26:58.240 --> 26:59.240
asked for my number.

27:00.420 --> 27:00.970
Look.

27:01.570 --> 27:02.480
Like this?

27:05.100 --> 27:06.910
My name is Fenghua.

27:08.690 --> 27:09.770
Stop filming.

27:10.160 --> 27:11.680
It's so embarrassing.

27:11.700 --> 27:12.360
Stop filming!

27:17.000 --> 27:17.590
Mom.

27:19.050 --> 27:19.950
Fenghua.

27:24.020 --> 27:25.610
Sorry.

27:32.740 --> 27:34.980
I really want you to be happy.

27:38.540 --> 27:39.230
But…

27:41.430 --> 27:43.670
we can't pursue our own happiness…

27:46.010 --> 27:47.490
at the expense of others.

27:52.470 --> 27:53.640
I know.

27:56.350 --> 27:58.560
I know we're not...

28:03.620 --> 28:04.880
Mom, stop.

28:06.480 --> 28:07.550
I know what you mean.

28:09.950 --> 28:12.330
My heart aches for you.

28:18.120 --> 28:20.030
My heart aches for you.

29:18.770 --> 29:28.340
[Tea]

29:41.290 --> 29:42.030
Morning.

29:42.640 --> 29:43.540
Morning.

29:43.570 --> 29:44.700
You just got up?

29:45.560 --> 29:46.550
I didn't sleep.

29:47.050 --> 29:48.140
You have something on your mind?

29:48.240 --> 29:49.040
Don't you?

29:50.960 --> 29:52.450
I'm not sentimental.

29:52.470 --> 29:53.600
You know that.

29:55.090 --> 29:56.040
Do you have a moment?

29:56.810 --> 29:58.400
How about taking a walk

29:58.820 --> 29:59.750
with your boyfriend?

30:00.720 --> 30:01.270
Where to?

30:06.300 --> 30:07.300
Wait. What are you doing?

30:08.810 --> 30:10.840
Well, I still have work to do.

30:16.710 --> 30:17.890
Meng said

30:18.050 --> 30:20.280
there's a lot to do before Bee goes public.

30:20.550 --> 30:22.040
He wants me to go back as soon as possible.

30:22.080 --> 30:23.040
He hopes

30:23.070 --> 30:25.190
I can go with him to ring the bell at NASDAQ.

30:26.510 --> 30:27.280
That's great.

30:28.030 --> 30:29.070
Join me.

30:29.360 --> 30:30.290
In what?

30:30.510 --> 30:31.420
Going back to Beijing.

30:31.560 --> 30:32.980
You need to get treatment.

30:33.000 --> 30:34.070
You can't delay it any longer.

30:38.240 --> 30:40.230
If you have any other concerns,

30:40.330 --> 30:41.320
tell me now.

30:41.440 --> 30:43.810
I'll see what I can do.

30:44.070 --> 30:45.640
Even if I tell you, you can't do anything about it.

30:50.810 --> 30:52.070
That's not necessarily true.

30:53.820 --> 30:58.780
[Honghuai Civil Affairs Bureau
Marriage Registration Office]

30:55.600 --> 30:56.670
What are you doing?

31:03.670 --> 31:04.670
Xia Fenghua,

31:05.260 --> 31:07.640
as a citizen of the People's Republic of China,

31:08.810 --> 31:10.260
I sincerely invite you

31:11.430 --> 31:12.890
to get married to me.

31:12.900 --> 31:13.460
[Honghuai Civil Affairs Bureau
Marriage Registration Office]

31:13.480 --> 31:14.660
[Honghuai Maternal and Child Health Center]

31:13.750 --> 31:15.200
Get up. No.

31:14.680 --> 31:18.900
[Honghuai Civil Affairs Bureau
Marriage Registration Office]

31:15.240 --> 31:16.720
You're being so reckless.

31:17.510 --> 31:19.030
What are you worried about?

31:22.160 --> 31:23.000
How about this?

31:23.460 --> 31:24.490
Since we're already here,

31:24.810 --> 31:25.880
let's go in and take a look.

31:25.900 --> 31:27.250
Consider it a rehearsal.

31:28.330 --> 31:29.180
[Honghuai Civil Affairs Bureau
Marriage Registration Office]

31:29.180 --> 31:30.510
[Honghuai Maternal and Child Health Center]

31:32.600 --> 31:33.440
It's okay.

31:33.480 --> 31:35.070
The gesture is enough, right?

31:35.070 --> 31:35.920
Mom, Dad.

31:35.940 --> 31:36.860
Come on, quickly.

31:36.890 --> 31:37.670
Hurry.

31:37.910 --> 31:38.880
Here.

31:38.900 --> 31:39.630
Take this.

31:45.530 --> 31:46.390
What do you think?

31:46.980 --> 31:48.190
I didn't lie, did I?

31:54.930 --> 31:56.280
Take this card.

31:59.140 --> 32:01.170
After the company goes public,

32:01.280 --> 32:02.640
most of my income will be transferred here.

32:06.730 --> 32:08.140
Your dad and I have money.

32:08.360 --> 32:09.970
Keep it for yourself.

32:14.080 --> 32:15.380
I'll live in Beijing

32:15.810 --> 32:17.250
and won't need a lot of money.

32:17.310 --> 32:18.790
I just need enough for daily needs.

32:20.430 --> 32:21.440
This money

32:23.520 --> 32:24.810
will be enough to support

32:25.460 --> 32:26.220
you and Dad for the rest of your lives.

32:33.720 --> 32:34.480
What do you mean?

32:37.790 --> 32:38.270
Mom.

32:40.640 --> 32:42.000
I understand

32:43.480 --> 32:44.510
all your concerns.

32:45.960 --> 32:47.840
All parents care for their children.

32:48.820 --> 32:50.450
Every parent

32:51.480 --> 32:53.720
wishes the best for their children.

32:56.960 --> 32:58.220
You're not wrong.

32:59.510 --> 33:00.510
As your son,

33:02.030 --> 33:03.270
I understand you.

33:04.560 --> 33:06.100
But as a man…

33:08.220 --> 33:10.040
my woman is sick now.

33:12.050 --> 33:13.660
You're asking me to give her up.

33:14.630 --> 33:16.240
Would I still be a man if I did that?

33:17.660 --> 33:19.510
Would I still be your son?

33:21.450 --> 33:22.090
Mom.

33:23.730 --> 33:25.640
That day when I came back from Beijing,

33:28.650 --> 33:31.070
I saw Fenghua sitting alone on the bridge

33:33.240 --> 33:34.480
and crying quietly.

33:38.390 --> 33:40.370
Do you know how much it pained me?

33:50.880 --> 33:53.030
I wish I were the one who was sick.

33:57.510 --> 33:58.920
Mom, don't worry.

34:00.780 --> 34:02.920
I'm not marrying Fenghua

34:03.070 --> 34:03.830
out of a sense of duty

34:04.940 --> 34:06.330
because she's sick.

34:08.199 --> 34:09.510
I truly love her.

34:13.260 --> 34:15.350
She means happiness to me.

34:17.179 --> 34:18.420
Without her,

34:21.280 --> 34:23.230
I don't know how to move on.

34:25.040 --> 34:26.480
I can't live without her.

34:27.530 --> 34:28.920
She needs me too.

34:30.639 --> 34:31.790
I've decided.

34:33.080 --> 34:34.040
Early tomorrow morning,

34:35.679 --> 34:37.469
I'll take Fenghua back to Beijing.

34:38.290 --> 34:39.889
We'll live

34:39.909 --> 34:41.139
our life together first.

34:41.810 --> 34:42.909
When the day comes

34:44.080 --> 34:45.239
that you approve,

34:45.780 --> 34:46.670
understand,

34:47.699 --> 34:48.659
and accept us,

34:50.100 --> 34:51.540
I'll bring her back again.

35:40.590 --> 35:44.250
[Household Register]

36:08.850 --> 36:11.610
♫The words you said linger in my mind♫

36:12.040 --> 36:15.100
♫I keep asking myself why♫

36:16.340 --> 36:19.180
♫I'm not good with words♫

36:16.700 --> 36:17.890
You know

36:17.950 --> 36:19.540
Wanghe.

36:19.580 --> 36:21.930
♫Once again, I was knocked down♫

36:19.830 --> 36:21.600
He's smart but stubborn,

36:22.150 --> 36:23.360
and a bit macho.

36:22.660 --> 36:24.180
♫The light you see♫

36:23.440 --> 36:25.150
In that aspect, he takes after his dad.

36:24.610 --> 36:26.140
♫Is not my light♫

36:25.320 --> 36:26.510
N-N-Nonsense.

36:27.020 --> 36:29.470
♫What does it even look like?♫

36:30.180 --> 36:31.860
If you marry a man like that,

36:30.360 --> 36:31.500
♫The girl you spoke of♫

36:32.250 --> 36:33.720
when things are good,

36:32.500 --> 36:34.380
♫The girl far away♫

36:34.150 --> 36:35.510
you'll be very happy,

36:35.070 --> 36:37.450
♫How will her story end?♫

36:36.890 --> 36:38.060
but when he's being stubborn,

36:38.370 --> 36:39.670
he can drive you crazy.

36:38.580 --> 36:40.180
♫Gazing at the stars and the distant sky♫

36:40.540 --> 36:42.980
Be mentally prepared.

36:40.560 --> 36:41.750
♫A faint light glimmering♫

36:42.630 --> 36:45.000
♫I'm chasing it all alone♫

36:46.060 --> 36:47.630
♫Watching loneliness fall like rain♫

36:47.880 --> 36:48.880
But don't worry.

36:47.930 --> 36:49.670
♫Shattered by them♫

36:49.710 --> 36:51.190
From now on…

36:50.130 --> 36:52.880
♫Blooming into flowers once again♫

36:53.070 --> 36:54.880
you and Mom

36:53.630 --> 36:53.940
♫But I...♫

36:54.280 --> 36:56.960
♫From the start to the very end, I've never changed♫

36:55.510 --> 36:57.110
are on the same side.

36:57.410 --> 36:58.640
♫In our relationship♫

36:59.050 --> 37:01.300
♫Who ended up the loser?♫

37:01.730 --> 37:03.310
♫Even if we start again♫

37:02.510 --> 37:05.030
We agreed on this. Only their second child can have the surname Xia.

37:03.760 --> 37:04.610
♫I'll still be here♫

37:05.030 --> 37:07.150
Alright, as you wish.

37:05.140 --> 37:06.440
♫Every choice we make♫

37:07.000 --> 37:07.930
♫Just leads us back to where we began♫

37:07.150 --> 37:09.360
From now on, Fenghua is your daughter,

37:08.640 --> 37:09.680
♫Endless crossroads♫

37:09.380 --> 37:10.860
and Wanghe is our son.

37:10.810 --> 37:11.710
♫Emotions out of sync♫

37:11.550 --> 37:13.880
Okay, let's not keep talking here.

37:12.470 --> 37:13.750
♫Look at me♫

37:13.960 --> 37:15.510
Let's get down to business.

37:14.400 --> 37:15.690
♫One last time♫

37:15.550 --> 37:16.800
Yes, get it done.

37:16.250 --> 37:17.310
♫Endless crossroads♫

37:16.840 --> 37:17.800
Hurry.

37:18.320 --> 37:19.600
Hello.

37:18.450 --> 37:19.250
♫Emotions out of sync♫

37:19.960 --> 37:21.960
Hello, the two of them are getting married.

37:20.140 --> 37:21.180
♫Look at me♫

37:21.810 --> 37:23.350
♫One last time♫

37:21.960 --> 37:22.590
Okay.

37:22.630 --> 37:24.190
Your household registration booklets.

37:26.450 --> 37:28.200
We all agree.

37:28.830 --> 37:29.890
I'm Xie Wanghe.

37:30.070 --> 37:31.470
I'm Xia Fenghua.

37:31.210 --> 37:33.460
[Name: Xie Wanghe]
[Name: Xia Fenghua]

37:31.610 --> 37:33.550
We voluntarily become husband and wife.

37:33.590 --> 37:35.070
From this day forward,

37:35.070 --> 37:36.630
we'll jointly shoulder

37:36.630 --> 37:39.110
the responsibilities and obligations that marriage bestows upon us.

37:39.110 --> 37:40.230
We'll be filial to our parents,

37:40.280 --> 37:41.480
educate our children,

37:40.420 --> 37:43.180
♫The words you said linger in my mind♫

37:41.480 --> 37:42.630
respect and love each other,

37:42.630 --> 37:43.760
trust and encourage each other,

37:43.610 --> 37:46.670
♫I keep asking myself why♫

37:43.800 --> 37:44.960
and understand each other.

37:44.900 --> 37:47.350
[Affiant: Xie Wanghe]

37:44.960 --> 37:47.550
In the future, whether in good times or bad,

37:47.450 --> 37:48.880
[Affiant: Xia Fenghua]

37:47.590 --> 37:49.550
rich or poor,

37:48.090 --> 37:50.600
♫I'm not good with words♫

37:49.450 --> 37:51.660
[Name: Xie Wanghe]
[Name: Xia Fenghua]

37:49.670 --> 37:51.760
in sickness or in health,

37:51.100 --> 37:53.450
♫Once again, I was knocked down♫

37:51.800 --> 37:53.800
young or old,

37:53.920 --> 37:55.510
we'll weather storms together,

37:54.180 --> 37:55.700
♫The light you see♫

37:55.550 --> 37:56.590
share our joys and sorrows,

37:56.130 --> 37:57.660
♫Is not my light♫

37:56.590 --> 37:57.760
support each other through thick and thin,

37:57.800 --> 37:58.920
and cherish each other for life.

37:58.330 --> 38:00.800
♫What does it even look like?♫

37:58.960 --> 38:02.000
We'll surely keep the vows we made today.

38:01.880 --> 38:03.020
♫The girl you spoke of♫

38:02.320 --> 38:03.070
Great!

38:04.020 --> 38:05.900
♫The girl far away♫

38:04.450 --> 38:05.950
Congratulations.

38:05.980 --> 38:07.280
Let me take a photo for you.

38:06.590 --> 38:08.970
♫How will her story end?♫

38:09.890 --> 38:11.700
♫Gazing at the stars and the distant sky♫

38:11.910 --> 38:15.710
[Marriage Certificate]

38:12.080 --> 38:13.270
♫A faint light glimmering♫

38:13.360 --> 38:14.630
Good. Good.

38:13.830 --> 38:16.520
♫I'm chasing it all alone♫

38:14.760 --> 38:16.760
-Mom, come. Mom.
-Come on.

38:17.030 --> 38:18.320
-Come on.
-Okay.

38:17.580 --> 38:19.150
♫Watching loneliness fall like rain♫

38:19.450 --> 38:20.970
♫Shattered by them♫

38:21.170 --> 38:23.220
I'll stand next to our daughter.

38:21.460 --> 38:23.960
♫Blooming into flowers once again♫

38:23.260 --> 38:24.030
You stand next to our son.

38:24.030 --> 38:24.750
Next to our son.

38:24.780 --> 38:25.250
♫But I...♫

38:25.680 --> 38:28.360
♫From the start to the very end, I've never changed♫

38:28.320 --> 38:29.070
Come on.

38:28.680 --> 38:29.910
♫In our relationship♫

38:29.110 --> 38:30.030
We're family.

38:30.030 --> 38:32.000
One, two, three!

38:30.450 --> 38:32.700
♫Who ended up the loser?♫

38:32.000 --> 38:35.550
We're married!

38:33.130 --> 38:34.710
♫Even if we start again♫

38:35.160 --> 38:36.130
♫I'll still be here♫

38:36.540 --> 38:37.840
♫Every choice we make♫

38:38.400 --> 38:39.330
♫Just leads us back to where we began♫

38:39.440 --> 38:41.590
It's so beautiful. What a good day.

38:40.040 --> 38:41.070
♫Endless crossroads♫

38:41.910 --> 38:43.000
♫Emotions out of sync♫

38:42.550 --> 38:43.320
Yeah. It looks so beautiful.

38:43.360 --> 38:44.550
Oh, right.

38:43.770 --> 38:44.890
♫Look at me♫

38:44.590 --> 38:46.320
What are your plans for the future?

38:45.620 --> 38:47.090
♫One last time♫

38:47.480 --> 38:48.400
We'll focus on her treatment first.

38:47.650 --> 38:48.510
♫Endless crossroads♫

38:48.440 --> 38:49.280
Other things can wait.

38:49.430 --> 38:50.650
♫Emotions out of sync♫

38:50.670 --> 38:51.670
I think

38:51.350 --> 38:52.580
♫Look at me♫

38:51.670 --> 38:53.930
maybe you should come back to Flower Street.

38:53.210 --> 38:54.750
♫One last time♫

38:54.050 --> 38:56.280
Fenghua can open another parcel delivery station.

38:56.680 --> 38:58.720
If you want to continue doing food delivery,

38:58.880 --> 39:00.440
your dad and I are still in good health

39:00.510 --> 39:01.610
and can help you.

39:01.750 --> 39:02.790
No rush.

39:03.440 --> 39:05.470
I'm a married man now.

39:05.730 --> 39:07.720
I'll listen to my wife on important family matters.

39:09.030 --> 39:10.920
You can't listen to her on everything.

39:11.000 --> 39:12.570
Given Fenghua's intelligence level…

39:13.150 --> 39:14.800
What's wrong with my intelligence level?

39:14.960 --> 39:17.440
I managed dozens of people in Beijing.

39:16.980 --> 39:22.290
[Flower Street]

39:17.510 --> 39:18.860
I can prove that's true.

39:18.960 --> 39:21.760
Fenghua had a bit of a reputation in parcel delivery in Haidian.

39:22.030 --> 39:23.440
A bit of a reputation?

39:23.480 --> 39:24.880
I was once the employee of the year.

39:24.540 --> 39:27.240
[Flower Street]

39:24.920 --> 39:26.320
How about you?

39:26.360 --> 39:27.480
Enough.

39:27.760 --> 39:29.600
You're getting all worked up over a little praise.

39:29.620 --> 39:31.000
Wanghe is a big boss,

39:31.000 --> 39:32.220
while you were just an employee.

39:32.280 --> 39:33.940
Who are you to brag here?

39:33.970 --> 39:34.800
Wanghe.

39:34.980 --> 39:36.360
Don't spoil her.

39:36.660 --> 39:37.750
She is

39:37.840 --> 39:39.150
getting too big for her boots.

39:39.440 --> 39:40.670
Dad!

39:40.800 --> 39:42.960
Most fathers-in-law dislike their sons-in-law,

39:42.960 --> 39:44.840
but you're taking his side.

39:44.840 --> 39:46.670
You've gone completely over to his side!

39:47.320 --> 39:48.970
A father-in-law will only

39:49.030 --> 39:50.180
like his son-in-law more and more.

39:50.210 --> 39:51.250
Yes.

39:52.400 --> 39:53.440
He's really...

39:57.580 --> 40:00.630
[Flower Street]

39:58.340 --> 39:59.740
I never thought in the end

40:01.030 --> 40:02.360
we'd all have to part ways.

40:08.500 --> 40:10.070
Our two families won't separate.

40:10.070 --> 40:11.970
We're one family now.

40:12.340 --> 40:13.470
We'll stick together.

40:13.500 --> 40:15.240
Of course, no matter who leaves,

40:15.260 --> 40:16.950
we'll stay together.

40:18.710 --> 40:23.370
[Flower Street]

40:18.850 --> 40:20.410
What are you getting sentimental about?

40:20.510 --> 40:21.590
We'll stay together.

40:42.340 --> 40:43.290
Sorry.

40:43.610 --> 40:44.440
Sir.

40:46.810 --> 40:48.810
You're working late?

40:49.630 --> 40:51.100
I made some noodles.

40:52.180 --> 40:53.590
Have you eaten?

40:55.430 --> 40:56.550
Would you like to try some?

40:58.120 --> 40:58.880
Is it proper?

40:59.070 --> 41:00.400
Of course.

41:00.450 --> 41:01.310
Come on in.

41:01.440 --> 41:02.440
There are plenty of noodles anyway.

41:02.480 --> 41:03.550
They'll be soggy tomorrow.

41:03.670 --> 41:04.470
Come on in.

41:04.520 --> 41:05.230
Try some.

41:05.600 --> 41:06.510
Just leave the bike here.

41:06.540 --> 41:07.840
Come on in.

41:10.200 --> 41:11.540
Careful.

41:12.270 --> 41:12.980
Careful.

41:13.240 --> 41:14.180
Here you go.

41:14.790 --> 41:15.750
Your noodles.

41:16.880 --> 41:17.740
Try them.

41:20.660 --> 41:22.220
Then give me your valuable feedback.

41:38.270 --> 41:39.100
What do you think?

41:57.670 --> 41:58.850
Are they good?

42:02.470 --> 42:03.490
They are

42:03.820 --> 42:05.540
the most delicious…

42:08.030 --> 42:09.440
noodles

42:10.340 --> 42:13.200
I've ever had.

42:14.940 --> 42:17.530
Uncle, be honest with me.

42:23.450 --> 42:25.760
I am being honest.

42:26.960 --> 42:30.320
You put your heart into these noodles.

42:31.840 --> 42:33.870
I can taste that.

42:36.420 --> 42:38.010
If you like them, have some more.

42:38.360 --> 42:39.650
There are more in the kitchen.

42:58.250 --> 42:59.190
Sir.

42:59.340 --> 43:00.560
Sir!

43:00.910 --> 43:02.340
Sir!

43:02.600 --> 43:03.830
Sir, what's wrong with you?

43:05.110 --> 43:05.910
Sir!

43:06.680 --> 43:07.830
Sir!

43:08.950 --> 43:09.940
Sir!
